{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>鍾麗淇(Margaret)今年8月底被發現身形明顯消瘦、面部表情僵硬，至9月更傳出緊急入住中文大學醫院深切治療部ICU，健康狀況引起關注。正當外界等待她報平安之際，細女Michela迎來11歲生日，鍾麗淇卻未有在慶祝合照中現身。原本歡樂的生日派對，因為一個重要身影缺席而添上心酸。</p>\n<h2>鍾麗淇9月被揭入ICU</h2>\n<p>鍾麗淇身體情況早於8月底已成為焦點，當時她出席好友周家蔚生日聚會，被留意到身形暴瘦，臉部狀態亦與以往不同。其後有消息指她於9月入住中文大學醫院深切治療部ICU，更一度傳出疑患上罕見「漸凍人症」運動神經元疾病，惟相關說法一直未獲本人證實。梁靖琪、周家蔚、姚樂怡及湯盈盈等「七魔女」成員曾先後到醫院探望Margaret。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e9%8d%be%e9%ba%97%e6%b7%87-icu-%e6%a2%81%e6%a6%ae%e5%bf%a0-%e8%88%8a%e6%84%9b-%e4%b8%83%e9%ad%94%e5%a5%b3-%e5%a7%9a%e6%a8%82%e6%80%a1-%e8%bb%8a%e9%9c%87%e4%ba%8b%e4%bb%b6-2442361/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鍾麗淇留醫近1個月 梁榮忠現身回應舊愛現狀 閨蜜姚樂怡親自回應病況</a></p>\n<h2>七魔女代為陪伴慶祝11歲生日</h2>\n<p>細女Michela滿11歲之際，由於鍾麗淇專心休養中，故此梁靖琪（Toby）、周家蔚（Janet）及姚樂怡帶同其子女為Michela慶祝11歲生日；相中Michela站在蛋糕造型氣球前微笑，姚樂怡亦留言祝願孩子們享受歡樂時光，繼續一起創造甜蜜回憶，她發文寫到</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>「Celebrating sweetie Michela’s 11th birthday! Hope all the kids have a wonderful time and keep creating sweet memories together（慶祝可愛的Michela 11歲生日！願孩子們都能度過一段美好的時光，並繼續共同創造甜蜜的回憶。）#BirthdayVibes#KidsParty#happy11thbirthday」</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>鍾麗淇與大女Isabella均未有出現在合照中，而患有四號染色體缺損綜合症的Isabella亦即將迎來16歲生日。這場由好友代為守護的慶祝，最終在笑容背後留下對鍾麗淇一家近況的深切牽掛。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e9%8d%be%e9%ba%97%e6%b7%87-icu-%e9%8d%be%e9%ba%97%e6%b7%87%e8%80%81%e5%85%ac-%e5%83%b5%e7%a1%ac-%e6%b6%88%e7%98%a6-%e4%bd%98%e8%a9%a9%e6%9b%bc-%e6%b5%81%e6%84%9f-2434475/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">49歲鍾麗淇入ICU 最新病情曝光 好友湯盈盈親自正面交代！周家蔚貼相後首現身醫院探望</a></p>\n<h2>鍾麗淇發聲明懇請停止揣測</h2>\n<p>面對外界接連討論病情，鍾麗淇於9月11日透過個人社交平台作出回應，懇請傳媒、公眾及支持她的朋友尊重家人私隱，不要再對其健康狀況作出揣測，並給予空間讓一家人自行處理。她同時表明，現階段會把心力放在健康、家人及身邊所愛的人身上。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e9%8d%be%e9%ba%97%e6%b7%87-%e9%81%ba%e5%9b%91-%e5%a5%b3%e5%85%92-isabella-%e5%9f%ba%e5%9b%a0%e7%97%85-%e4%b8%83%e9%ad%94%e5%a5%b3-%e6%bc%b8%e5%87%8d%e4%ba%ba%e7%97%87-%e5%ae%b6%e6%97%8f%e9%81%ba-2436451/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鍾麗淇入ICU「七魔女」輪流探望 早已為2女兒訂立遺囑 交由1人專門照顧罕見病長女</a></p>\n<h2>姚樂怡被捕獲探病 </h2>\n<p>10月2日，姚樂怡於10月2日前往醫院探望鍾麗淇，面對傳媒追問病情是否好轉、何時轉院，以及能否進食等問題，她以手勢回應表示「OK」，未有進一步透露細節。姚樂怡離開期間亦不忘提醒在場記者「睇車呀」，但始終未有透露鍾麗淇目前情況，令外界繼續關注其康復進度。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e9%8d%be%e9%ba%97%e6%b7%87-%e6%bc%b8%e5%87%8d%e4%ba%ba%e7%97%87-icu-%e9%81%ba%e5%82%b3%e7%97%85-%e5%ae%b6%e6%97%8f%e7%97%85%e5%8f%b2-%e5%93%a5%e5%93%a5-%e5%aa%bd%e5%aa%bd-2434532/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鍾麗淇惡化入ICU原因疑流出後發聲明 兄19歲早逝 母離世前癱瘓無法說話 家族遺傳病史曝光</a></p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944911783747819_16242362226af5c32ba46d7.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鍾麗淇 細女michela （圖片來源：Instagram@shermingyiu）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944911783747819_16242362226af5c32ba46d7.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Instagram@shermingyiu）</figcaption></figure>\n</p></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449118265994523_8818728286af5c3304d7d8.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鍾麗淇 細女michela （圖片來源：Instagram@shermingyiu）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449118265994523_8818728286af5c3304d7d8.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Instagram@shermingyiu）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178956583385859566_518517196aaa9b8a8a307.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鍾麗淇 細女michela （圖片來源：Instagram@yogachung）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178956583385859566_518517196aaa9b8a8a307.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Instagram@yogachung）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178956584980732429_6030410206aaa9b9a9e56d.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鍾麗淇 細女michela （圖片來源：Instagram@yogachung）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178956584980732429_6030410206aaa9b9a9e56d.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Instagram@yogachung）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e9%8d%be%e9%ba%97%e6%b7%87-icu-%e6%a2%81%e6%a6%ae%e5%bf%a0-%e8%88%8a%e6%84%9b-%e4%b8%83%e9%ad%94%e5%a5%b3-%e5%a7%9a%e6%a8%82%e6%80%a1-%e8%bb%8a%e9%9c%87%e4%ba%8b%e4%bb%b6-2442361/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鍾麗淇留醫近1個月 梁榮忠現身回應舊愛現狀 閨蜜姚樂怡親自回應病況</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e9%8d%be%e9%ba%97%e6%b7%87-icu-%e9%8d%be%e9%ba%97%e6%b7%87%e8%80%81%e5%85%ac-%e5%83%b5%e7%a1%ac-%e6%b6%88%e7%98%a6-%e4%bd%98%e8%a9%a9%e6%9b%bc-%e6%b5%81%e6%84%9f-2434475/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">49歲鍾麗淇入ICU 最新病情曝光 好友湯盈盈親自正面交代！周家蔚貼相後首現身醫院探望</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e9%8d%be%e9%ba%97%e6%b7%87-%e9%81%ba%e5%9b%91-%e5%a5%b3%e5%85%92-isabella-%e5%9f%ba%e5%9b%a0%e7%97%85-%e4%b8%83%e9%ad%94%e5%a5%b3-%e6%bc%b8%e5%87%8d%e4%ba%ba%e7%97%87-%e5%ae%b6%e6%97%8f%e9%81%ba-2436451/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鍾麗淇入ICU「七魔女」輪流探望 早已為2女兒訂立遺囑 交由1人專門照顧罕見病長女</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e9%8d%be%e9%ba%97%e6%b7%87-%e6%bc%b8%e5%87%8d%e4%ba%ba%e7%97%87-icu-%e9%81%ba%e5%82%b3%e7%97%85-%e5%ae%b6%e6%97%8f%e7%97%85%e5%8f%b2-%e5%93%a5%e5%93%a5-%e5%aa%bd%e5%aa%bd-2434532/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鍾麗淇惡化入ICU原因疑流出後發聲明 兄19歲早逝 母離世前癱瘓無法說話 家族遺傳病史曝光</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e9%8d%be%e9%ba%97%e6%b7%87-%e5%a4%a7%e7%b4%b0%e9%9d%a2-%e6%b6%88%e7%98%a6-%e4%bd%98%e8%a9%a9%e6%9b%bc-%e5%9f%ba%e5%9b%a0-%e5%9b%9b%e8%99%9f%e6%9f%93%e8%89%b2%e9%ab%94%e7%bc%ba%e6%90%8d%e7%b6%9c-2432095/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">49歲鍾麗淇突暴瘦臉容僵硬惹擔憂 佘詩曼親自交代好姊妹病況</a>\n</br></p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T15:04:07.312979+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1507,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:47:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T18:37:51.416123+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T14:57:40.676497+00:00","content_hash":"87f1b284b08b7e60f7af15a0d503234e10ff987ff2859ee27624d28f487c837f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}